FAILAT 1000
Copy RAM:rxt/hashtime RAM:hashtime
Protect RAM:hashtime +e
Date >RESULTS:rq-time.txt
RAM:hashtime 1000000 1 RESULTS:jent-raw-noise --max-mem 0 >>RESULTS:rq-time.txt
Date >>RESULTS:rq-time.txt
RAM:hashtime 1000 1000 RESULTS:jent-raw-noise-restart --max-mem 0 >>RESULTS:rq-time.txt
Date >>RESULTS:rq-time.txt
Echo "QUIET DONE" >RESULTS:rq-done.txt
